      "decision_index": 189,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Lethal damage was available this turn without casting any spells. Attack with Magus of the Moon (2/2) and Broadside Bombardiers (2/2) for 4 combat damage (opponent to 5), then activate Bombardiers' Boast ability sacrificing Magus of the Moon (CMC 3) to deal 2+3=5 damage to opponent's face for exactly 9 damage lethal.",
      "action_taken": "Chose to cast a spell (likely Pyrogoyf) during precombat main instead of attacking for lethal.",
      "better_line": "Go to combat, attack with both Magus of the Moon and Broadside Bombardiers for 4 damage (opponent to 5), then Boast with Bombardiers sacrificing Magus of the Moon to deal 5 damage to opponent for exact lethal.",
      "type": "blunder",
