      "decision_index": 189,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Johnny missed lethal damage this turn. Broadside Bombardiers can attack (2 damage, opponent to 7), then use Boast to sacrifice Magus of the Moon (CMC 3) dealing 2+3=5 damage to opponent (down to 2), then cast Pyrogoyf for 4 mana (available from 2x City of Traitors + Mountain). Pyrogoyf's ETB deals damage equal to its power (at least 5 given card types in graveyards: land, artifact, enchantment, sorcery, instant) to any target, killing the opponent. Instead, Johnny cast The One Ring which doesn't advance the kill.",
