      "decision_index": 194,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Missed lethal. Opponent is at 9 life with no blockers. Pyrogoyf (costs {3}{R}, payable with City of Traitors x2 + Mountain or Simian Spirit Guide) enters as a 6-power creature (6 card types in graveyards: land, artifact, enchantment, creature, sorcery, instant) and its ETB deals 6 damage to the opponent. Then attacking with Broadside Bombardiers (2 menace) and Magus of the Moon (2) deals 4 more combat damage, totaling 10 damage against 9 life.",
