      "decision_index": 205,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "At 7 life with Pyrogoyf on the stack (which will deal 6 damage on ETB), Qwen3 Vorthos activated Sneak Attack instead of countering with Force of Will. Sneak Attack putting Atraxa into play doesn't prevent the 6 ETB damage from Pyrogoyf, and since it's postcombat main, Atraxa can't even attack before being sacrificed at end step. This leaves them at 1 life in a desperate position instead of safely at 7.",
      "action_taken": "Activated Sneak Attack to put a creature into play, which doesn't prevent Pyrogoyf's 6 damage ETB trigger",
