      "decision_index": 210,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Pyrogoyf has approximately 6 power (6 card types in graveyards) and its ETB will deal 6 damage to any target. At 7 life, letting it resolve likely puts Qwen3 Vorthos to 1 life from the ETB trigger, leaving them dead to virtually any attack next turn. The opponent has Magus of the Moon and Broadside Bombardiers that can attack.",
