      "decision_index": 210,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Pyrogoyf's ETB trigger will deal 6 damage (6 card types in graveyards) targeting Qwen3 Vorthos, dropping them from 7 to 1 life. At 1 life with opponent having Broadside Bombardiers (which can sacrifice creatures for direct damage) and Magus of the Moon on board, Qwen3 is essentially dead. Force of Will could counter the Pyrogoyf, preventing it from entering and avoiding the lethal ETB trigger entirely.",
